(label "FPGA_3V3" (at 1084.58 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d816b2bd-32f2-5ec9-a484-1844a75b7c15"))
(text "SN64 FPGA - LFE5U-85F CABGA381, CONFIGURATION FLASH, JTAG, N64 HOST ISOLATION" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "42362f97-d544-520d-9a8b-5ec3d39747e6"))
(text "Rails: VCC = FPGA_1V1 (1.1 V, DS-02012 Table 3.2), VCCAUX = FPGA_2V5 through FB401 (TN-02038 Figure 3.1), every VCCIO0/1/2/3/6/7/8 = FPGA_3V3.\nBank plan: 0 = N64 PI/CIC/SI behind the bus switches (top bank, hot-socket capable), 1 = spare (HDMI removed in 0.5-fpga: video goes to the console over the cartridge bus), 2+3 = cartridge translators B side, 6+7 = clocks, Si5351 I2C, ADC, power control, LED, 8 = configuration flash.\nGND: all 113 GND balls (the LFE5U pinout lists the SERDES-supply positions as GND). RESERVED (10 balls): not connected (DS-02012 4.1). Unused user I/O: open (tri-state + weak pull-down after configuration, TN-02039 4.5)." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1a1f811d-791b-53fc-bad4-08d73ece0116"))
(text "Configuration: CFG[2:0] = 010 Master SPI (CFG0/CFG2 to GND, CFG1 4.7k to VCCIO8). PROGRAMN/INITN/DONE 4.7k to VCCIO8 (TN-02038 Table 6.2).\nU307 holds PROGRAMN low until fpga_rails_ok (DS-02012 3.5: MSPI needs VCCIO8 above the flash VIH before VCC/VCCAUX reach VPORUP, or PROGRAMN/INITN held low).\nU405 W25Q128JVSIQ: QE=1 factory fixed (IQ option), EBh = 2 mode + 4 dummy clocks, tCLQV 6 ns; bitstream at 0x000000, N64 bootstrap at 0x400000 (bootrom-flash.md).\nMCLK: R405 33R series at the FPGA + R406 1k pull-up; CSSPIN R407 4.7k at the flash; IO2/IO3 10k pull-ups. JTAG: TDI/TMS/TDO 4.7k up, TCK 4.7k down (TN-02038 Table 6.1); TARGET_VREF = VCCIO8 rail via R414." (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a68db04a-4687-56b4-b496-93645f0b2960"))
(text "N64 HOST ISOLATION: U402-U404 SN74CB3Q3384A FET bus switches (A = N64 edge, B = FPGA bank 0), VCC = FPGA_3V3.\nOE = NOT(HOST_3V3 present): U406 Schmitt inverter on the R416/R417 divider. USB-only (HOST_3V3 absent): OE high, switch off.\nFPGA_3V3 absent: switch unpowered, \"isolation during power off\" + Ioff (TI SCDS114E). R418 keeps OE at VCC (datasheet).\nNo series resistors: SummerCart64 a1e7996d connects J_N1 straight to the FPGA (netlist checked)." (at 20.32 640.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3b01197f-3166-55af-a180-0ca312b1f14d"))
(text "DRAFT 0.5-fpga: schematic only - no PCB, no SI or power-integrity analysis, no hardware test. FPGA_1V1/2V5/3V3 come from the power sheet (its #FLG302-#FLG304 are their ERC origins). #FLG404 marks FPGA_VCCAUX, fed only through FB401.\nPin map: interfaces/fpga-pin-map.csv; constraints: fpga/constraints/sn64_board.lpf; doc: docs/design/fpga-schematic.md." (at 20.32 680.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "27a8b2da-9e37-553e-97c8-23e046ee8455"))
